---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="Who is behind Scam-Proof Money, how we write our guides and how we check our facts.">
  <div class="page">
    <h1>About Scam-Proof Money</h1>
    <p class="lead">Free, plain-language guides to the scams that cost people the most, and the one right move for each.</p>

    <h2>What we do</h2>
    <p>
      Scam-Proof Money is a free website and video channel for people in the United States, United Kingdom,
      Canada and Australia. Each guide explains how one scam works, lists the warning signs, and ends with
      the right move. Our short videos on <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@scamproofmoney" rel="noopener">YouTube</a> and
      <a href="https://www.facebook.com/scamproofmoney" rel="noopener">Facebook</a> use two characters,
      Grandma June and Slick, to "rewind" a scam and show how it could have gone differently.
    </p>
    <p>
      The characters and videos are made with the help of AI tools. The facts in the guides come from the
      sources listed on each page.
    </p>

    <h2>How we check our facts</h2>
    <ul class="plain">
      <li>Every guide lists its sources at the bottom, so you can read them yourself.</li>
      <li>We rely on government agencies and regulators first, such as the FTC, FBI and FCC, then banks, security researchers and news reports.</li>
      <li>Every guide shows the date we last reviewed it and which countries it applies to.</li>
      <li>Rules differ by country. Where they do, we say so, and we link to the official place to report a scam in each country.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Scams change quickly, so details can go out of date. If you spot a mistake, please tell us on
      our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>What we don't do</h2>
    <ul class="plain">
      <li>We can't tell you whether a specific message or call is real. We can show you the patterns.</li>
      <li>We don't give legal or financial advice. See our <a href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a>.</li>
      <li>We never ask for your passwords, account numbers or ID numbers, and you should never type them here.</li>
      <li>We don't ask for payment. Every guide and every sheet in the <a href="/family-kit/">Family Protection Kit</a> is free.</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</Base>
